((Creates a banner with image, title, and text))
__Parameters__
* imageURL = URL of the banner image
* title = Banner title
* text = Banner text content

{{{
[{Banner imageURL="/path/to/image.jpg" title="Welcome" text="Welcome to our site"}]
}}}
